   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "With common ratio \\( 3x^{2} \\), the geometric series gives \\( f^{\\prime}(x) = 8 + 24 x^{2} + 72 x^{4} + 216 x^{6} + \\cdots \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99067",
         "rule_named": "geometric series"
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Integrate term by term, raising each power by 1 and dividing by the new power, and add the constant \\( f(0) = 1 \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99003",
         "rule_named": "term-by-term antiderivative"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "The first 5 nonzero terms are \\( 1 + 8 x + 8 x^{3} + \\frac{72}{5} x^{5} + \\frac{216}{7} x^{7} \\).",
